<!--
  The base image maximizes and removes decorations from every matching window.
  Wine also exposes some Banking4 popups as normal windows, so matching that
  type alone expands them to fill the desktop.

  Use an intentionally unmatched class to disable this automatic rule. Let
  Banking4 choose window sizes and retain title bars for manual maximizing.
  Keep criteria on separate lines for the base image's selection-file parser.
-->
<Type>normal</Type>
<Class>Banking4WebDisableAutoMaximize</Class>
